# Repository agent instructions

## Shared code and documentation policy

Follow `.github/DEVELOPMENT_POLICY.md` and `.github/development-policy.json`.
Run `node scripts/check-modularity.cjs --changed` for advisory review signals.
Code, configuration and documentation use the same policy. Size alone is not a
failure or a reason to split; record the design review for changed large files.
Existing safety, type, test and approval requirements remain in force.
